<title>FINLAND: Kone 1996 profit falls 39 percent.</title>
<headline>Kone 1996 profit falls 39 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			   124 vs 202</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   2.79 vs 13.67</p>
<p> Sales					     10,619 vs 9,523</p>
<p> Operating profit				   228 vs 274</p>
<p>NOTE - The median forecast for Finnish elevator maker Kone Oy was for a 82 million markka.</p>
<p>Proposed dividend (markka) (for old B-share)10 vs 10</p>
<p>Proposed dividend (markka) (for new B-share) 5 vs n/a</p>
<p> Depreciation					 426 vs 419</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 106 vs 88 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 16 charge</p>
<p> Profit before minorities, taxes		124 vs 186</p>
<p> Minorities				    charge 1 vs 1 charge</p>
<p> Net profit					    18 vs 67</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Kone Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0248</p>
</text>
